# Google OAuth Web Client ID
#
# Get yours at:  https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/credentials
#
# BEFORE creating the client, you must:
#   1. Enable "Google Drive API"  (APIs & Services → Library)
#   2. Configure OAuth consent screen (External) with scopes:
#        openid, email, profile,
#        https://www.googleapis.com/auth/drive.appdata
#      Add yourself as a test user while in Testing mode.
#
# WHEN creating the client ID, pick:
#   - Application type:  Web application
#   - Authorized JavaScript origins:  http://localhost:5172
#      (add your production URL here too when deploying)
#
# COPY the "Client ID" (not the Client Secret). It MUST end with
# ".apps.googleusercontent.com". The Client Secret starts with "GOCSPX-"
# and is NOT what you want.
#
# Replace the placeholder below with your real Client ID, then restart
# the dev server (Vite only reads .env on startup).
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=your-client-id-here.apps.googleusercontent.com
